    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2123ca8b3cd42f052cb1779a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙有一个想法。\r\n想要更多的『连接』。\r\n特别是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fecd0a8547f562ff6d54143ade1a55c0060fb0f6c45a43c2e3e7bb5bd289232b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65d6114eadc31dd54ef40502",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前一周期的赛马娘……难道说？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "594c13a515e5b0c464f8b77758e4634962747e72e6c2a577a6a51a6a57500c7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
