      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与“前一周期的赛马娘”的“交流”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19f2ad872f2eadfd1cf24e9ed9290908415a6194bb8345f6576eb3c668bc3aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:246277df1c9b5a0f1fd35cae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我能大致明白她的意思。\r\n前一周期，也就是上一世代的赛马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "96b9b5f491ddaa3b25181a2bd53349979efc027a204128004dad310ebfeab6de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98d71e37a03be77bf9b065d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周围的人们都开始祝贺起我来。\r\n我笑着应承着，却伸手指向新宇宙的方向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "696746fdff3435c04281b1dd94d9611372f872f2fb3eba316feb8d5bb2e99b7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94fc17d74c04abaae6980133",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而这就意味着——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2449fadf6ae2594c0e77697c6d99c5002211a8fd3e08455771fb6bd6b0cdb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c15396c29835d4a6c612217f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
