    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1e61ac26e1544fee3b2019d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——『宝冢纪念』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d51bc06540796567e4e96c8fea976795367d2626043f37140b4d2d52464e593",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae747254638ae0f44f5b1f40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就制度而言，的确是可能的。\r\n经典级的赛马娘在六月之后，的确可以参加有\r\n古马级赛马娘参加的混合赛事……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0cd843ffae9f942cede430628eb73ac20d877c22a47e3516b36a5d5005da5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba36cfed91ca000a1595170",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，她的确可以参加六月后半的GⅠ\r\n级赛事『宝冢纪念』。不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f7e3cf6b0275da5b8c59ed2115e783c1fd5875f4f2a259db8104321e25d1d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a1801223c174fe2e63d6f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠的有力竞争者在经典级选择参加『宝\r\n冢纪念』，的确相当少见。要问为什么的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a77bdd409054b0ca389c6be80b78c49ab218fcf04965f0a235ba4a2c466a8caf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5dccac08b9e21ab0b881b1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这实在是太过胡来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9315a9c317ba21b37a68480da42dbbf5cd9e6b8a561443d4943dc0124747bdd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9e12af454bf8922fb3a9bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这意味着，短短一个月之内连战两场GⅠ级赛事。\r\n而且参加『宝冢纪念』的大多是实力雄厚的古马\r\n级赛马娘，对经典级的她而言实在是压力过大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a356871cfa55ef2080648d41b96de2490f003aea0f33862c0eea5237f089b98b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
